.* PROGRAM: the task menu for the programmer's tasks.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='PROGRAM'.
:IMPORT NAME=STRDBG PNLGRP=QHDBGCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=STRPDM PNLGRP=QHPDMCMD.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=PROGRAM HELP=HLPPROGRAM KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Programming
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD STRPGMMNU' HELP='PROGRAM/OPT1'.Programmer menu
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD STRPDM' HELP=STRPDM.Programming Development Manager (PDM)
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='MENU UTILITIES' HELP='PROGRAM/OPT3'.Utilities
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?STRDBG' HELP=STRDBG.Programming language debug
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='MENU CMDSQL' HELP='PROGRAM/OPT5'.Structured Query Language (SQL) pre-compiler
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ASKQST' HELP='PROGRAM/OPT6'.Question and answer
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD ?STRCPYSCN' HELP='PROGRAM/OPT8'.Copy screen image
:MENUI OPTION=9 ACTION='CMD STRCSP' HELP='PROGRAM/OPT9'.Cross System Product/Application Execution (CSP/AE)
:MENUI OPTION=50 ACTION='MENU PROGRAMS36' HELP='PROGRAM/OPT50'.System/36 programming
:MENUI OPTION=70 ACTION='MENU CMDPGM' HELP='PROGRAM/OPT70'.Related commands
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPPROGRAM.Programming - Help
:P.Tools for writing, building and debugging programs. Option 4 prompts the
debugger's start command; option 70 lists the program commands.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Information Assistant
:PD.Shows menu INFO.
:PT.F16=System Main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PROGRAM/OPT1'.Programmer menu
:P.Option 1. Runs the STRPGMMNU command&colon. Programmer menu.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PROGRAM/OPT3'.Utilities
:P.Option 3. Shows menu UTILITIES&colon. Utilities.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PROGRAM/OPT5'.Structured Query Language (SQL) pre-compiler
:P.Option 5. Shows menu CMDSQL&colon. Structured Query Language (SQL)
pre-compiler.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PROGRAM/OPT6'.Question and answer
:P.Option 6. Runs the ASKQST command&colon. Question and answer.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PROGRAM/OPT8'.Copy screen image
:P.Option 8. Runs the STRCPYSCN command&colon. Copy screen image.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PROGRAM/OPT9'.Cross System Product/Application Execution (CSP/AE)
:P.Option 9. Runs the STRCSP command&colon. Cross System
Product/Application Execution (CSP/AE).
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PROGRAM/OPT50'.System/36 programming
:P.Option 50. Shows menu PROGRAMS36&colon. System/36 programming.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PROGRAM/OPT70'.Related commands
:P.Option 70. Shows menu CMDPGM&colon. Related commands.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
